SUMMARY:IEMDC 2027: Digest submission (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:IEEE International Electric Machines and Drives Conference (IEM
 DC 2027)\n\nDigest submission: 1 Nov 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConf
 erence: May 17-20\, 2027\nLocation: Milwaukee\, USA\n\nAll dates:\n  Diges
 t submission: 1 Nov 2026\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Digest acceptance not
 ification: 15 Jan 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final paper submission 
 and early registration: 15 Mar 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call f
 or papers states no timezone. This is counted as UTC+12\, the earliest it 
 could plausibly mean\, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline 
 rather than after it.\n\n16th edition\, marking the conference's 30th anni
 versary and returning to Milwaukee.\n\nCall for papers: https://www.iemdc.
 org/\nDetails: https://langestefan.github.io/powersystem-deadlines/confere
 nce/iemdc27
